  "notes": "BALANCES [AT f] [FROM ...] [WHERE ...] is SELECT account, sum(f(position)) GROUP BY account ORDER BY account_sortkey(account). The order is by account type (Assets, Liabilities, Equity, Income, Expenses), then by name. Every account with postings is listed, even when its balance nets to the empty inventory (Assets:US:Federal:PreTax401k, Liabilities:AccountsPayable). beanquery names the second column SUM((position)). Lots are kept, so the result depends on booking."
